# Third-party test models. The ones under build-default/Test Models/ are other
# people's work and are NOT redistributable from this fork -- see
# doc/slice-verification.md for where to obtain them. "build*" on line 17 already
# covers that directory, but only incidentally; these rules state the intent so a
# renamed or relocated build directory cannot start tracking them.
# Models we own live in tests/models/ instead and ARE tracked.
**/Test Models/
*.stl.zip

# G-code is always generated. Note resources/shapes/ IS tracked (it ships the
# upstream sample .stl files), and the GUI writes its exports there by default,
# so ignore the output without touching the models.
resources/shapes/*.gcode
*.gcode.tmp
